        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaEdomi wamumbanda washakama mwituŋa daUzi, luŋaku, tiyaku kuwaha, lupasa lwakahita lwakashika nikudeyi nawa. Wakasheta, wakadivúula, wakekala nzekesi.",
